# Web UI (`app/`, `src/web/`)

## Structure

- Form state: `src/web/hooks/useAnalysisForm.ts` — repo slug, allowed list, `useAI`, API call to `/api/analyze`
- Report: `src/web/report/ReportView.tsx` — shared with CLI HTML export
- Confidence UI: `src/web/report/confidence.ts` — dots/labels; **confidence ≠ compliance** (row color = allowed/not allowed)

## Components

- UI primitives live under `src/web/components/ui/` (PascalCase filenames: `Button.tsx`, `Card.tsx`, …)
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for class merging

## API route (`app/api/analyze/route.ts`)

- Validate body with `ConfigSchema` from `src/core/types`
- Pass `GITHUB_TOKEN` from env to `GitHubClient`
- Return full `AnalysisReport` JSON; errors as `{ error: string }` with 500

## Do not

- Duplicate detection or compliance logic in the client
- Add heavy dependencies for one-off UI; keep the bundle small

When changing report shape, update `ReportView` and `terminal-reporter.ts` together for parity.
